# Matchline frontend environment
#
# Variable NAMES and safe placeholders only. Never commit a real secret,
# password, token or model key to this file (CONTRIBUTING.md).

# Backend origin for the server-side /api/v1 proxy.
#
# Deliberately NOT prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_: the backend origin must never reach
# the browser bundle. The browser always calls the relative path /api/v1.
#
# Unset  -> demo mode. Next.js route handlers replay the frozen BE-00 demo
#           manifest and every response is labelled DEMO DATA.
# Set    -> the request is proxied to this origin instead, and the demo
#           handlers never run.
#
# MATCHLINE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
